{{also|Strecken|strécken}}
==German==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|de|gmh|strecken}}, from {{inh|de|goh|strecken}}, from {{inh|de|gem-pro|*strakjaną}}, from {{der|de|ine-pro|*(s)treg-|t=rigid, stiff}}. Compare {{cog|nl|strekken}}, {{cog|nds|streken}}, {{cog|en|stretch}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|[ˈʃtʁɛkŋ̩]|[ˈʃtʁɛkən]|lang=de}}
* {{audio|De-strecken.ogg|Audio|lang=de}}

===Verb===
{{de-verb-weak|streckt|streckte|gestreckt}}

# to [[straighten]], [[stretch]]
#: ''Sie streckte ihre müden Glieder.'' - She stretched her tired limbs.
# to [[elongate]], [[lengthen]]
# to [[dilute]], [[cut]]
#: ''Er streckte den Wein mit Wasser.'' - He diluted the wine with water.

====Conjugation====
{{de-conj-weak|streck|gestreckt|h}}

